===============================================================================

v0.16.2 (2026-08-28)

Features and improvements
  - add support for ZDoom GL nodes (XGLN/XGL2/XGL3, compressed or not)

Fixed bugs
  - a door or lift standing in a wall the occlusion fade opens now fades with
    it, instead of staying solid in the middle of the hole
  - a monster standing half under a crusher is now crushed by it
  - a DEHACKED attack chain that fires two different actions now throws both,
    instead of repeating its first one
  - a sector fenced off by self-referencing lines is no longer its own
    neighbour, so switches that lower such a platform work
  - the 36/70/71/98 "lower to highest neighbour" specials no longer raise a
    floor that is already level with its highest neighbour
  - a BFG shot no longer misses a monster standing lower or higher than 
    the player
  - a use press no longer reaches a switch through the wall in front of it, and
    grunts at the wall the way vanilla does


