v0.15.2 (2026-08-23)

Features and improvements
  - DEHACKED action pointers apply (Pointer and [CODEPTR], MBF's ten included)
  - auto-aim locks onto switches a shot triggers, not just onto monsters
  - spectres are slightly better visible
  - tuned the auto-camera a bit

Fixed bugs
  - fog of war reveals what is around the player first, not in BSP order
  - a bullet fires the shoot-triggered lines it flies through, not just the
    one it stops on
  - items tucked just out of walking reach (an alcove, a window ledge)
    can now be picked up
  - a BOOM friction sector slippery enough to clamp at zero friction froze
    the player for the rest of the level
  - fixed problems with nodes built by an buggy builder (hello ksutra.wad)
    - black holes and wrong flats in the floor on maps whose nodebuilder
      filed a seg into the wrong side of its line
    - no more walking through the air over a floor drawn far below:
      where a nodebuilder filed a leaf under the wrong sector, physics
      now stands on the same floor the renderer paints


