v0.14.2 (2026-08-19)

Features and improvements
  - auto camera mode (the new default): the zoom follows how open the area
    around the player is, the tilt how far the view reaches the way you look
  - finishing a campaign ends it: an episode/game-complete card instead of
    walking on into E1M9 or MAP31, and a pistol start in DOOM's next episode
    where the set has one
  - added new "Pistol start every level" setting

Fixed bugs
  - fixed various rendering problems (again)
  - fixed various lightning issues
  - a monster whose box hangs over a ledge no longer freezes solid


